### ========================================
### Tables
### ========================================

### Create Table 1
POST {{baseUrl}}/tables
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "tableNumber": "T1"
}

### Get table by ID
GET {{baseUrl}}/tables/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Get all tables
GET {{baseUrl}}/tables
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Search tables with keyword
GET {{baseUrl}}/tables?keyword=VIP
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Search tables with pagination
GET {{baseUrl}}/tables?page=0&size=2&sort=tableNumber,asc
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### WAITER floor view — meja kosong (siap ditempati)
GET {{baseUrl}}/tables?status=AVAILABLE&size=100
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### WAITER floor view — meja terisi
GET {{baseUrl}}/tables?status=OCCUPIED&size=100
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Invalid table status (400: "Invalid table status: 'DIRTY'. Allowed: AVAILABLE, OCCUPIED")
GET {{baseUrl}}/tables?status=DIRTY
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Update table (PUT)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/tables/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "tableNumber": "T1-Updated"
}

### Patch table (partial)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/tables/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "tableNumber": "T1-Main"
}

### Delete table
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/tables/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}


### ========================================
### Dinings — E2E Happy Path (dibayar via invoice)
### ========================================
### Response POST /dinings menyertakan guestToken (opaque) + guestCode (6 digit).
### Copy guestToken ke {{guestToken}} dan guestCode ke {{guestCode}} di environment
### untuk dipakai di endpoint publik /guest/dinings dan /my/dinings (bawah).
### customerId opsional; bila diisi HARUS ada di customers (404 bila tidak).

### Step 1: Open dining on table 1
POST {{baseUrl}}/dinings
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "tableId": 1
}

### Step 2: Add order to dining 1 (order DINE_IN dibuat via dining — satu-satunya jalur sah)
POST {{baseUrl}}/dinings/1/orders
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "customerId": 1,
    "customerName": "Asep",
    "notes": "Less sugar",
    "items": [
        {
            "menuId": 2,
            "quantity": 1,
            "modifiers": [
                {  "modifierOptionId": 20 },
                {  "modifierOptionId": 13 }
            ]
        }
    ]
}

### Step 3: Confirm → (DINE_IN tidak butuh pembayaran untuk confirm)
POST {{baseUrl}}/orders/1/confirm
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Step 4: Prepare 
POST {{baseUrl}}/orders/1/prepare
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Step 5: Ready 
POST {{baseUrl}}/orders/1/ready
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Step 6: Inspect invoice dining (invoice dining terbit otomatis saat order pertama masuk)
GET {{baseUrl}}/invoices?diningId=1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Step 7: Bayar invoice — cash (langsung PAID; applied/excess tercatat otomatis)
POST {{baseUrl}}/payments
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "invoiceId": 1,
    "paymentProvider": "INTERNAL",
    "paymentDetail": "Testing cash"
}

### Step 8: Complete order
POST {{baseUrl}}/orders/2/complete
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Step 9: Close dining — guard: semua order COMPLETED/CANCELLED dan invoice PAID/VOID
POST {{baseUrl}}/dinings/1/close
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}


### ========================================
### E2E FLOW — Happy Path Multiple Orders (satu invoice, dua order)
### ========================================

### Open dining on table 3
POST {{baseUrl}}/dinings
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "tableId": 3
}

### Add order #1 to dining 2
POST {{baseUrl}}/dinings/2/orders
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "customerId": 1,
    "customerName": "Budi",
    "notes": "Extra hot",
    "items": [
        {
            "menuId": 1,
            "quantity": 1,
            "modifiers": [
                { "modifierOptionId": 1 }
            ]
        }
    ]
}

### Confirm order 2
POST {{baseUrl}}/orders/2/confirm
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Prepare order 2
POST {{baseUrl}}/orders/2/prepare
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Ready order 2
POST {{baseUrl}}/orders/2/ready
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Complete order 2
POST {{baseUrl}}/orders/2/complete
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Add order #2 (additional) to dining 2 — invoice dining yang sama otomatis nambah baris
POST {{baseUrl}}/dinings/2/orders
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "customerId": 1,
    "customerName": "Budi",
    "notes": "Ice please",
    "items": [
        {
            "menuId": 2,
            "quantity": 1,
            "modifiers": [
                { "modifierOptionId": 6 }
            ]
        },
        {
            "menuId": 1,
            "quantity": 3,
            "modifiers": [
                { "modifierOptionId": 2 }
            ]
        }
    ]
}

### Confirm order 3
POST {{baseUrl}}/orders/3/confirm
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Prepare order 3
POST {{baseUrl}}/orders/3/prepare
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Ready order 3
POST {{baseUrl}}/orders/3/ready
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Complete order 3
POST {{baseUrl}}/orders/3/complete
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Update order 3 (tambah item sebelum dibayar) — invoice dining ikut tersinkron
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/orders/3
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "items": [
        {
            "id": 3,
            "menuId": 1,
            "quantity": 3,
            "modifiers": [
                { "id": 5, "modifierOptionId": 2 }
            ]
        },
        {
            "menuId": 2,
            "quantity": 1,
            "modifiers": []
        }
    ]
}

### Bayar invoice dining 2 (lihat invoiceId dari GET /invoices?diningId=2)
GET {{baseUrl}}/invoices?diningId=2
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Bayar invoice
POST {{baseUrl}}/payments
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "invoiceId": 2,
    "paymentProvider": "INTERNAL",
    "paymentDetail": "CASH-002"
}

### Close dining 2
POST {{baseUrl}}/dinings/2/close
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}


### ========================================
### E2E FLOW — Confirm Without Payment
### ========================================

### Open dining on table 4
POST {{baseUrl}}/dinings
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "tableId": 4
}

### Add order to dining 3
POST {{baseUrl}}/dinings/3/orders
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "customerId": 1,
    "customerName": "Dina",
    "notes": "No sugar",
    "items": [
        {
            "menuId": 2,
            "quantity": 1,
            "modifiers": [
                { "modifierOptionId": 6 }
            ]
        }
    ]
}

### Confirm order — succeeds without payment (DINE_IN)
POST {{baseUrl}}/orders/4/confirm
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Close dining — invalid: invoice dining masih OPEN (400 "Tagihan belum lunas")
POST {{baseUrl}}/dinings/3/close
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Jalur darurat: void invoice → baru close bisa jalan
### (void hanya boleh untuk invoice OPEN tanpa pembayaran)
POST {{baseUrl}}/invoices/3/void
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### ========================================
### VALIDATION — Table
### ========================================

### Table not found (404)
POST {{baseUrl}}/dinings
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "tableId": 999
}

### Table already occupied (400 "Table is already occupied")
POST {{baseUrl}}/dinings
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "tableId": 1
}

### tableId missing (400)
POST {{baseUrl}}/dinings
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{}### ========================================
### VALIDATION — Dining
### ========================================

### Add order to closed dining (400 "Cannot add order to a closed dining")
POST {{baseUrl}}/dinings/1/orders
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "customerId": 1,
    "customerName": "Test",
    "notes": "Should fail",
    "items": [
        {
            "menuId": 1,
            "quantity": 1,
            "modifiers": [
                { "modifierOptionId": 1 }
            ]
        }
    ]
}

### Add order - invalid: customerId tidak ada di customers (404 "Customer not found with id: N")
POST {{baseUrl}}/dinings/2/orders
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "customerId": 9999,
    "customerName": "Test",
    "items": [
        { "menuId": 1, "quantity": 1, "modifiers": [] }
    ]
}

### Add order — invalid: invoice sesi sudah lunas (400, pesan PAID)
### "Sesi ini sudah lunas (INV-...). Tutup sesi atau minta tagihan baru ke kasir"
POST {{baseUrl}}/dinings/2/orders
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "customerId": 1,
    "customerName": "Test",
    "notes": "Should fail",
    "items": [
        { "menuId": 1, "quantity": 1, "modifiers": [] }
    ]
}

### Add order — invalid: tagihan sesi sudah di-void (400, pesan VOID — beda dengan PAID)
### "Tagihan sesi ini sudah di-void (INV-...). Tutup sesi atau minta tagihan baru ke kasir"
POST {{baseUrl}}/dinings/3/orders
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "customerId": 1,
    "customerName": "Test",
    "notes": "Should fail",
    "items": [
        { "menuId": 1, "quantity": 1, "modifiers": [] }
    ]
}

### Close dining already closed (400 "Dining is not open")
POST {{baseUrl}}/dinings/1/close
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Close dining not found (404)
POST {{baseUrl}}/dinings/999/close
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Close dining — invalid: invoice belum lunas (400 "Tagihan belum lunas (...). Selesaikan pembayaran dulu")
### (contoh: dining 3 masih punya invoice OPEN — lihat flow "Confirm Without Payment")
POST {{baseUrl}}/dinings/3/close
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Get dining not found (404)
GET {{baseUrl}}/dinings/999
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}


### ========================================
### GET / INSPECT
### ========================================

### Get dining by ID
GET {{baseUrl}}/dinings/2
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Get all dinings
GET {{baseUrl}}/dinings
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Get dinings with pagination
GET {{baseUrl}}/dinings?page=0&size=5&sort=createdAt,desc
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### WAITER floor view — sesi yang masih berjalan (meja terisi)
GET {{baseUrl}}/dinings?status=OPEN&size=100
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Riwayat sesi yang sudah ditutup
GET {{baseUrl}}/dinings?status=CLOSED&size=20
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Invalid dining status (400: "Invalid dining status: 'PAID'. Allowed: OPEN, CLOSED")
GET {{baseUrl}}/dinings?status=PAID
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}


### ========================================
### TABLE STATE VERIFICATION
### ========================================

### Table should be AVAILABLE (after dining closed)
GET {{baseUrl}}/tables/2
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Table should be OCCUPIED (dining 3 still open)
GET {{baseUrl}}/tables/4
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}


### ========================================
### GUEST DINING — PUBLIK (tanpa login; identifikasi via guestToken)
### Lihat API_CONTRACT.md §L2. Sesi CLOSED: GET masih 200, POST ditolak.
### ========================================

### Guest: lihat status sesi (dipakai juga untuk polling FE tamu)
### invoiceStatus: null | OPEN | PARTIALLY_PAID | PAID | VOID
GET {{baseUrl}}/guest/dinings/{{guestToken}}

### Guest: resolve via kode 6 digit (fallback QR gagal scan; hanya sesi OPEN)
GET {{baseUrl}}/guest/dinings/by-code/{{guestCode}}

### Guest: tambah order (TANPA customerId — identitas tidak pernah diterima dari body publik)
POST {{baseUrl}}/guest/dinings/{{guestToken}}/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "customerName": "Tamu Meja 1",
    "notes": "Extra es",
    "items": [
        { "menuId": 1, "quantity": 2, "modifiers": [{ "modifierOptionId": 13 }] }
    ]
}

### Guest - invalid: token salah (404 generik "Session not found")
GET {{baseUrl}}/guest/dinings/wrongtoken123

### Guest - invalid: sesi sudah CLOSED (400)
POST {{baseUrl}}/guest/dinings/{{guestToken}}/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "items": [
        { "menuId": 1, "quantity": 1, "modifiers": [] }
    ]
}

### Guest - invalid: tagihan sesi sudah lunas (400 "Sesi ini sudah lunas (INV-...)")
POST {{baseUrl}}/guest/dinings/{{guestToken}}/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "items": [
        { "menuId": 1, "quantity": 1, "modifiers": [] }
    ]
}


### ========================================
### MY DINING — MEMBER LOGIN (identitas dari JWT; API_CONTRACT.md §L3)
### Login dulu sebagai customer (register di customer.http, lalu login di auth.http),
### simpan accessToken-nya ke {{customerToken}}.
### ========================================

### Member: lihat status sesi (payload sama dengan guest)
GET {{baseUrl}}/my/dinings/{{guestToken}}
Authorization: Bearer {{customerToken}}

### Member: tambah order — customerId otomatis dari profil member
### customerName kosong → nama profil; terisi → override (mis. "Budi +1")
POST {{baseUrl}}/my/dinings/{{guestToken}}/orders
Authorization: Bearer {{customerToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "customerName": "",
    "notes": "Dari member",
    "items": [
        { "menuId": 2, "quantity": 1, "modifiers": [] }
    ]
}

### Member - invalid: akun tanpa profil customer (403 "Customer profile not found for this account")
### (mis. login pakai akun staf admin@rascal.id — tidak punya profil member)
POST {{baseUrl}}/my/dinings/{{guestToken}}/orders
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "items": [
        { "menuId": 2, "quantity": 1, "modifiers": [] }
    ]
}

### Member - invalid: tanpa token (401 standar — beda fail-mode dari jalur guest publik)
POST {{baseUrl}}/my/dinings/{{guestToken}}/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "items": [
        { "menuId": 2, "quantity": 1, "modifiers": [] }
    ]
}
